1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
What do you hate most
about Fenty Beauty?

2
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:07,550
It’s always sold out!
I can never get my shade.

3
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,140
Honestly?

4
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,140
The shade range is too good.

5
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:12,730
I can’t decide.

6
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:14,750
So I bought two shades.

7
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:18,380
Nothing. I love it.
This is my blush today.

8
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:21,220
Oh, it looks just like
a second skin.

9
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:24,000
Yes, but I hate waiting
for a restock!

10
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,000
The only downside?
Getting your hands on it.
